{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-111-1","title":"Psalms 111:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The psalmist by his example incites others to praise God for his glorious, 5 and gracious works. 10 The fear of God breeds true wisdom.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3468. B.C. 536. Praise ye the Lord. Heb. Hallelujah. 106:1,48 As this is an alphabetical Psalm, every member of each verse beginning consecutively with a letter of the Hebrew alphabet, Hallelujah, which begins with the fifth, must be considered as the title.</p>\n<p>I will. 9:1; 103:1; 138:1 assembly. 22:25; 35:18; 40:9,10; 89:5,7; 107:32; 108:3; 109:30; 149:1 1Ch 29:10-20; 2Ch 6:3,4; 20:26-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-2","title":"Psalms 111:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>works. 92:5; 104:24; 139:14; Job 5:9; 9:10; 26:12-14; 38:1-41; 41:1-34 Isa 40:12; Jer 32:17-19; Da 4:3; Eph 1:19; 2:7-10; Re 15:3 sought. 77:11,12; 104:24,34; 107:43; 143:5; Job 37:7; Ec 3:11; 1Pe 1:10-12 that have. 92:4; Pr 17:16; 18:1,2; 24:14; Ro 1:28; 8:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-3","title":"Psalms 111:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>honourable. 19:1; 145:4,5,10-12,17; Ex 15:6,7,11; Eph 1:6-8; 3:10; Re 5:12-14 righteousness. 103:17; 119:142,144; Isa 51:5,6,8; Da 9:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-4","title":"Psalms 111:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>He hath. 78:4-8; Ex 12:26,27; 13:14,15; De 4:9; 31:19-30; Jos 4:6,7,21-24 1Co 11:24-26 gracious. 86:5,15; 103:8; Ex 34:6,7; Isa 63:7; Mic 7:18,19; Ro 5:20,21 Eph 1:6-8; 1Ti 1:14 full. 78:38; 112:4; 145:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-5","title":"Psalms 111:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>hath given. 34:9,10; 37:3; Isa 33:16; Mt 6:26-33; Lu 12:30 meat. Heb. prey. he will. 89:34; 105:8; 106:45; Ne 1:5; Da 9:4; Lu 1:72</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-6","title":"Psalms 111:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>shewed. 78:12-72; 105:27-45; De 4:32-38; Jos 3:14-17; 6:20; 10:13,14 that he. 2:8; 44:2; 78:55; 80:8; 105:44</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-7","title":"Psalms 111:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>works. 85:10; 89:14; 98:3; De 32:4; 2Ti 2:13; Re 15:3,4 all his. 19:7; 105:8; 119:86,151,160</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-8","title":"Psalms 111:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>They. Mt 5:18; Ro 3:31 stand fast. Heb. are established. are done. 19:9; 119:127,128; Ro 7:12; Re 15:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-9","title":"Psalms 111:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>sent. 130:7,8; Ex 15:13; De 15:15; Isa 44:6; 63:9; Mt 1:21; Lu 1:68 Eph 1:7,14; Tit 2:14; Heb 9:12; 1Pe 1:18-20; Re 5:9 he hath. 5; 2Sa 23:5; 1Ch 16:15; Isa 55:3; Jer 33:20,21; Ga 3:15-17 Heb 13:20 holy. 89:7; 99:3,5,9; Ex 15:11; De 28:58; Isa 6:3; Mal 1:11; 2:2; Lu 1:49 Re 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-111-10","title":"Psalms 111:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":111,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":111,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>fear. Job 28:28; Pr 1:7; 9:10; Ec 12:13 a good understanding. or, good success. 1:3; De 4:6; Jos 1:7,8; Pr 3:4; 2Ti 3:15-17 do his commandments. Heb. do them. Joh 13:17; Re 22:14 his praise. Mt 25:21,23; Joh 5:44; 12:43; Ro 2:7,29; 1Co 4:5; 2Co 4:17; 1Pe 1:7</p>"}]}